WEBVTT

00:07:29.809 --> 00:07:32.798
because jumping from
the "what" to the "do"

00:07:32.822 --> 00:07:35.353
is meaningless if you don't know why.

00:07:35.377 --> 00:07:38.180
Because when it gets hard,
when it gets tough,

00:07:38.204 --> 00:07:40.363
when your friends walk away from you,

00:07:40.387 --> 00:07:42.522
when your supporters forget you,

00:07:42.546 --> 00:07:45.156
when you don't win your first race --

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:47.915
if you don't know why,
you can't try again.

00:07:48.363 --> 00:07:50.403
So, first know what you want.

00:07:50.427 --> 00:07:52.450
Second, know why you want it,

00:07:52.474 --> 00:07:54.831
but third, know how
you're going to get it done.

00:07:55.323 --> 00:07:57.601
I faced a few obstacles in this race.

00:07:57.625 --> 00:07:59.569
(Laughter)

00:07:59.593 --> 00:08:00.743
Just a few.